---

### 2. `shoplite-gitops-infra/.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Terraform local working directory & providers
**/.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Terraform state & plan files (contain sensitive outputs)
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Sensitive variable files
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Kubernetes / Helm secrets
*secret*.yaml
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# OS & Editor artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/